&lt;/h2>&lt;p>DSM: Device Shared Memory, 主机与加速器共享的内存区域，用于传递控制信号和数据&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Runtime</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/runtime/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 14:41:40 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/runtime/</guid><description>&lt;p>在主板上增加 PLX 芯片以提供更多的 PCIe 通道&lt;/p>
&lt;p>PCIe 设备插到 PCIe 插槽需要由 PLX 芯片提供支持&lt;/p>
&lt;p>一个PCIe插槽在物理层面上确实只能插入一个设备。例如，你只能插入一张显卡或一块SSD到一个PCIe插槽中。但是通过PLX芯片等交换设备，可以让多个PCIe设备通过该插槽共享带宽并同时被RC识别和使用(PLX芯片实际上是在分配带宽，这并没有改变某一时刻 RC 只会和某个插槽上的一台设备进行通信的事实，对于资源有限的PCIe插槽环境比较有意义）&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Function Simulator</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/function-simulator/</link><pubDate>Fri, 23 Aug 2024 15:33:50 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/function-simulator/</guid><description>&lt;p>The key class of function simulator is &lt;code>TopUnit&lt;/code>. We can use &lt;code>TopUnit.CycleStep()&lt;/code> to begin the execution of simulator.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>In &lt;code>CycleStep()&lt;/code>, we will call the &lt;code>Frontend()&lt;/code> and &lt;code>Backend()&lt;/code>, the former is used to update the many types of counters and the latter is used to execute instructions sequence.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>In &lt;code>Backend()&lt;/code>, we will call the following functions one by one&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>BackendCommit()&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>BackendMemory()&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>BackendExecute()&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>BackendSchedule()&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>Among all these functions, the third function &lt;code>BackendExecute()&lt;/code> will execute all the instructions.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Graph Compiler</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/graph-compiler/</link><pubDate>Thu, 07 Mar 2024 21:26:29 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/graph-compiler/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="对于系统结构的理解" class="heading-element">&lt;span>对于系统结构的理解&lt;/span>
