&lt;/h2>&lt;p>主要是对于 应用层代码，编译层 和 运行时库 之间关系的理解&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>MLIR</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/mlir/</link><pubDate>Thu, 07 Mar 2024 21:26:29 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/mlir/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="ir" class="heading-element">&lt;span>IR&lt;/span>
